<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Corpgro makes 28.2 million rand acquisition.</title>
<headline>Corpgro makes 28.2 million rand acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Industrial holdings group Corpgro Ltd said on Friday it had bought Midrand-based B&amp;B Hardware Distributors and 65 percent of its Cape operation for 28.2 million rand.</p>
<p>The purchase will be paid for in cash and shares.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
